BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_315933565@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T015941Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260825T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260825T201500
SUMMARY:Tuesday Brewsday Thirsty Monk Biltmore Park
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nWe are heading down to Thirsty Monk South. 
 It's a beautiful run with some rolling hills to keep it interesting. If yo
 u don't want to run\, no worries\, walk or just meet up for a beer afterwa
 rd.\n\nThirsty Monk 5 Mile\nL out of Brewery on Schenck Parkway\nR on Whit
 e Ash Dr\nBear L at the fork up a short hill\nR on Viburnum\nL on Olmsted 
 Dr\nL on Burnside\nL on Pinchot\nL on Red Fox Circle\nR on Pichot\nR on Co
 lumbine\nL on Heathbrook Circle\nL On Columbine\nL on Schenck Crest\nStrai
 ght onto Thetford\nContinue on Thetford past the movie theater\nReturn to 
 Thirsty Monk\n\n3 Mile Route\nL out of Brewery on Schenck Parkway\nR on Wh
 ite Ash Dr bear L at the end\nR on Viburnum\nR on Columbine\nR On East Sch
 enck Crest\nL on Schenck Parkway\nBack to Thirsty Monk\nL on Olmsted Dr
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/315933565/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260801T141816Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260801T141816Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_314753193@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T015941Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260827T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260827T200000
SUMMARY:Thursday Run 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nCome run 1\, 3\, or 6 miles and stay for a 
 beer and soccer tennis after at Olde London Road.\n\nRoutes-\n1 miler:\nRI
 GHT out of OLR parking lot\nContinue around roundabout at Clingman\, and h
 ead toward the river on Lyman St.\nRIGHT on River Arts Place\nCross Rivers
 ide onto the Greenway\nRight on the Greenway to the Craven St Park put in 
 (the dock)\nTurn around and go back the same way to OLR\n\n3 miler:\nStart
  the same as 1 miler\nContinue onto Craven St. Bridge\nLEFT onto Greenway 
 after bridge\nFollow Greenway all the way until it ends at Haywood Rd.\nRI
 GHT onto Haywood Rd\, go across the bridge\nCross the Roundabout at Robert
 s St. and continue onto Clingman\nContinue on Clingman\nLEFT onto Owens Be
 ll Lane\nLEFT onto Hilliard at the top of the hill\nLEFT onto W Haywood\, 
 follow all the way down to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts\nFollow Roberts back
  to OLR\nPass OLR to Bartlett\, turn around and come back to OLR\n\n6 mile
 r:\nAfter the W Haywood downhill to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts St. take to
  Lyman and head back to the Greenway\nLEFT onto the Greenway\, take all th
 e way to Amboy\nRIGHT on Amboy to cross the bridge\nRIGHT into French Broa
 d River Park\, run the loop at the park\nCross back over the bridge on Amb
 oy and run the Greenway back to the roundabout\nFollow Lyman back to OLR
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/314753193/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260512T140558Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260512T140558Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_316114385@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T015941Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260901T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260901T201500
SUMMARY:Tuesday Brewsday- The Mule
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nNew brewery alert. The Mule has been a new 
 venue to explore. The routes tack on to areas run in the East Asheville ar
 ea before Hurricane Helene. Expect to explore some rolling hills with frie
 nds and then enjoy a libation afterwards. We'll meet out front. We look fo
 rward to seeing you there!\n\nThe Mule 3.0 miles\nL on Crayton\ngo around 
 gate\nR on Raleigh Rd\nL on Onteora Blvd\nR on Wilmington\nL on Old Fairvi
 ew\nL on Fairview Rd\nL on LIberty\nStay straight on\nCrayton back to\nThe
  Mule\n\nThe Mule 5.0\nL on Crayton\ngo around gate\nR on Raleigh Rd\nL on
  Onteora\nR on Wilmington\nL on Old Fairview\nL on Fairview Rd\nL on Main 
 St\nL on Alta ave\nL on Ridge ave\nR on Fairview Rd\nR on Liberty St\nStay
  straight on\nCrayton back to\nThe Mule
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/316114385/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260814T131725Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260814T131725Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
